{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013uVz1Puhp2Xu9doMaBtntj","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context files, the cluster ID field in the new metadata record is defined as **String** type.\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in the KIP-1262 proposal (`discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md`), which discusses enabling auto-formatting directories and describes the new `ClusterIdRecord` used to persist the cluster ID. In the \\\\\\\"Schema & Upgrade Paths\\\\\\\" discussion section, there was a debate about the type:\\\\n\\\\n- Jun Rao suggested: \\\\\\\"ClusterId field should be UUID type for consistency with TopicRecord\\\\\\\"\\\\n- Kevin's response: \\\\\\\"Current code accepts String cluster IDs; UUID restriction would complicate upgrade path for existing clusters with non-UUID IDs\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThe response clarifies that the actual design uses **String** type to maintain compatibility with existing clusters that may have non-UUID cluster IDs.\\\\n\\\\n**Source file**: `/store/discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md` (lines 44-45)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"prs/21632-clusterid-metadata-image.md\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":22.96,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":1,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":94231,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":8551,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0362111,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1924}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c71ad075-30b3-44b1-834c-56526a29ee7b","uuid":"6144f3e8-b839-4fab-891a-9a07b59227c4","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:24:00.844Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context files, the cluster ID field in the new metadata record is defined as **String** type.\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in the KIP-1262 proposal (`discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md`), which discusses enabling auto-formatting directories and describes the new `ClusterIdRecord` used to persist the cluster ID. In the \\\\\\\"Schema & Upgrade Paths\\\\\\\" discussion section, there was a debate about the type:\\\\n\\\\n- Jun Rao suggested: \\\\\\\"ClusterId field should be UUID type for consistency with TopicRecord\\\\\\\"\\\\n- Kevin's response: \\\\\\\"Current code accepts String cluster IDs; UUID restriction would complicate upgrade path for existing clusters with non-UUID IDs\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThe response clarifies that the actual design uses **String** type to maintain compatibility with existing clusters that may have non-UUID cluster IDs.\\\\n\\\\n**Source file**: `/store/discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md` (lines 44-45)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"prs/21632-clusterid-metadata-image.md\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":22.96,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":1,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":94231,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":8551,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0362111,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1924}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on the context files, the cluster ID field in the new metadata record is defined as **String** type.\\n\\nThis is documented in the KIP-1262 proposal (`discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md`), which discusses enabling auto-formatting directories and describes the new `ClusterIdRecord` used to persist the cluster ID. In the \\\"Schema & Upgrade Paths\\\" discussion section, there was a debate about the type:\\n\\n- Jun Rao suggested: \\\"ClusterId field should be UUID type for consistency with TopicRecord\\\"\\n- Kevin's response: \\\"Current code accepts String cluster IDs; UUID restriction would complicate upgrade path for existing clusters with non-UUID IDs\\\"\\n\\nThe response clarifies that the actual design uses **String** type to maintain compatibility with existing clusters that may have non-UUID cluster IDs.\\n\\n**Source file**: `/store/discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md` (lines 44-45)\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"prs/21632-clusterid-metadata-image.md\",\"discussions/kip-1262-auto-formatting.md\"],\"seconds\":22.96,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":1,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":94231,\"cache_write_tokens\":8551,\"cost_usd\":0.0362111,\"input_tokens\":66,\"output_tokens\":1924}}"}}}
